{"asset_key":"ep4/herohub_story_14411240","episode":"ep4","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"14411240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1441124001:1":{"text":"드워프의 저주는 아직 풀리지 않았지만 드래곤은 사라졌어. 깊은바위 수정도 사라졌지...","source_cn":"矮人的诅咒没解除，龙却飞走了，深岩晶也没了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26DB342F4BD6A7D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1441124002:1":{"text":"이제 지하의 에세일들도 지상의 진실을 알게 되었어. 어쩌면 올라와보고 싶어할 지도 모르겠네.","source_cn":"地底的艾塞勒也得知了地上世界的真相，保不准要来地表看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67EBE917085040A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1441124003:1":{"text":"아휴, 정말 큰일을 벌였다니까!","source_cn":"唉，真是搞出了不小的乱子啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66E57504514D538A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1441124004:1":{"text":"지상의 드워프들이 바빠지겠어.","source_cn":"地表的矮人们，该忙起来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEE0AD196F6DD1E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}